{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_deepcl_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_deepcl_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "藍調",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_deepcl_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7f647e832c269c655df4c74be33e4f5704a341169f94b7b8909367ef36558644",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "滴答，滴答……\n畫畫，畫畫……\n滴答，滴答……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島信使",
      "text": "您好，有您的信件！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "放在門口就好，謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島信使",
      "text": "好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "剛剛想好怎麼下筆，這下子全忘了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "唉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "不管了，等一下再想吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "先去看看送來的是什麼東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "一幅畫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "可我只會畫畫，不會買畫，到底是誰寄來的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "奇怪，收件人和寄件人都沒寫名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但深海色很明白，這幅畫就是寄給她的。\n無論是用色，還是筆觸，都讓她感到熟悉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "雖然不知道是誰寄來的，但謝謝你的禮物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "於是，深海色將它放在了畫架旁，隨後重新開始了自己的創作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "過了許久，一幅畫作完成，但那不是深海色所想的畫，而是“那幅畫”的臨摹。\n她的注意力不斷被那奇異的熟悉感吸走，這讓她的眼睛不由自主離開畫布，讓她的思維不斷臨摹畫框裡的色彩，讓她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "或許我該休息一下了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "今天也太熱鬧了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "你怎麼來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "來看你畫畫，今天有新畫嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "還沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "但畫布上不是已經畫了一些東西了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "一條小溪，一片樹林，一座木屋？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "那是臨摹的，有人送給了我一幅畫，我的腦袋裡都是它，下筆也只能臨摹它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "臨摹也是畫啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "那是複製別人的思想與技法，只能算是練習，不能說是我的畫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "對我來說沒什麼區別，只要是用你的手拿著畫筆蘸著顏料塗出來的資訊，我都喜歡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "總之，今天不畫了，走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "怎麼了？你怎麼也在看那幅畫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "我覺得……好熟悉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "你不這麼覺得嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "因為這份親切感我已經一筆都畫不下去了，你要是喜歡的話，就把它帶回去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "但你已經見過它了，我帶走它是沒用的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "也是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "那我們該怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "去調查？去探險？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "好像也沒有別的辦法了……就聽你的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "好的，我們現在就出發！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "等、等等！你不準備一下嗎？至少帶上這幅畫！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島信使",
      "text": "你問我這個包裹是哪裡來的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "是的，上面既沒有寫收件人也沒有寫寄件人，但這確實是我的包裹，所以我想詢問一下，它是從哪裡寄過來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "總不能是突然——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島信使",
      "text": "對不起，我確實沒有印象收到過這份郵包。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島信使",
      "text": "我從外面回來，檢查的時候沒有看到過這個包裹，你確定是我送的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島信使",
      "text": "不過你別擔心，我現在就去查，一定能給你一個答覆的，說不定是人事那邊的反詐騙演習呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島信使",
      "text": "請稍等一下，我馬上回來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "你跑到哪裡去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "剛剛給我送包裹的信使先生說沒有印象……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "我問了我的朋友，它們知道這幅畫是從哪裡來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "是哪裡來的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "順著河流一直走，一直走，就能看到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "一條小溪，一片樹林，一座木屋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "別開玩笑了，大地上有這麼多溪流，我怎麼知道是哪一條啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "朋友們把位置告訴我了，我來為你帶路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "好吧，你先在這裡等我一下……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "你去哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "我去拿畫筆和畫布。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "等等，先停一下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "讓我休息一會……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "我們走了多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "幾天？幾週？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "你累了嗎，需要我幫你背畫畫工具嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "不用，我是畫家，這我還背得動……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "怎麼了，你也想畫畫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "我想，但我不會，學也學不會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "那就幫我準備顏料吧，反正都休息了，我想畫一會畫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "還是不行嗎……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "即使看著眼前截然不同的景色，但在深海色筆下畫出的，仍是那幅畫中的場景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "現在這幅畫不好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "雖然木屋還沒畫，但……太奇怪了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "明明顏料都不一樣，為什麼最後還是會畫得分毫不差？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "你還在臨摹嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "唉，是啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "畫自然景色畫得逼真也叫作臨摹嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "那叫擬真。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "不一樣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "嗯，不一樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "那我覺得，你應該要說自己是在擬真而不是在臨摹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "能不能別混淆概念了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "你看看前面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "越過畫布，深海色突然發現，眼前被畫布擋住的景色，正是自己筆下剛繪製出的那一方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "這，怎麼回事？我們眼前不應該是草地嗎？哪裡來的溪流？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "你畫得真好，和自然一模一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "順著這條小溪走下去，我們會不會就到目的地了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "或許吧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "唉，真是越來越奇怪了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "幫我收一下畫架好嗎，助手？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "你在疑惑什麼，深海色？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "我覺得……很熟悉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "還是那幅畫嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "是這個地方，這片森林，這條小溪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "畫裡畫的就是這個地方……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "我看到前面的小屋了，木製的，就是畫裡的那一座。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "終於到了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "就是這裡嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "從我這個角度看，是一樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "那我們進去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "嗯，我在門口等你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "你不想進去看看嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "我進不去，我看不見門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "門就在這裡，你看，我把它打開了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "我還是什麼都沒看見，對不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "你去吧，我在這裡等你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "那，你等我一下，我馬上回來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這屋子已經很久沒有人住了，傢俱破敗不堪，畫作四處散落，所有東西都蒙上了厚厚一層灰。\n隨之而來的，是如影隨形的熟悉感，沒有那幅畫上的那麼詭異，取而代之的，是親切與眷戀。\n就像是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "家？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深海色隨手拿起一幅畫，抹去灰塵，露出殘破的真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "當繪畫成為生命，生活便墮落為毒藥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "除了順流而下，再無選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "樹林、溪流、木屋……怎麼都是一模一樣的畫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深海色取下一幅牆上的掛畫，吹開枷鎖，往事猛然掙脫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "聽說遠方有著為繪匠而備的天堂……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "從此順流而下，便能抵達。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "咳咳……這個橢圓畫框不是肖像畫才用的嗎？怎麼還是它？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "不會連素描本裡也……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深海色翻開桌上的素描本，紙張顫動，傳達出陳舊的警示。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "畫不出美的手，未見過美的心，未抵天堂，自毀近在咫尺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "順流……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "果然……每一頁都只有屋外的景色。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "這座屋子的主人，大概是瘋了吧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "既然她畫了這麼多，那這一幅，也留給她好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "畫落在脫毛的地毯上，發出一聲悶響。\n它將在這裡被遺忘，被塵埃淹沒。\n直到……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "她畫下的最後一幅畫，成為永恆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "你回來了，有什麼發現嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "那幅畫呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "丟在屋子裡了，我不想再記起它了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "那麼，你能畫畫了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "在這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "那不還是只能畫出同樣的場景？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "不試試看怎麼知道呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "嗯……也對，我試試看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "這不是同一幅畫嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "不一樣的，你看，這裡的光線和角度，還有用色的方法都和那幅畫有區別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "好像，缺了些什麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "不是技巧上的問題……奇怪……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "……你之前說，你的朋友告訴你畫從這裡來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "是的，有什麼問題嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "你的朋友，能夠走進屋子嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "它們做不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "那它們怎麼能知道畫的所在……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "“順流而下，在溪流的盡頭。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "它們是這樣說的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "溪流的盡頭有什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "有屋子的主人想要的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "哼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "助手，這幅畫你先幫我收起來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“輔助幹員”",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "然後，我們可以沿著溪流走下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "溪流的盡頭究竟有什麼呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "助手，還有水嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "只有眼前的海水了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "好餓……好累……沒人想來這裡畫畫吧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "畫畫？當然不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "來這裡是為了活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "你看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "順著助手所指的方向看去，能看到一堆雜亂的繪畫工具。\n顏料早已乾涸，木製畫架碎落一地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "真可憐……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "別的地方已經沒有她的容身之所了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "而生存，是容不下雜質的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "為了活下去，就得拋棄一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在一堆礁石中，深海色看到了一個熟悉的畫框。\n支離破碎，瀕臨死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "這就是包裹裡的那幅畫……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "她想要把畫送給我……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "而我把它丟回了屋子裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "是的，畢竟你已經不需要它了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "或許我該……留個紀念？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "那我們可以把你的臨摹寄回去，怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "就這樣做吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "那我們呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "我們繼續前進。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "這裡已經是盡頭了，你要去哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深海色踏入了海洋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "她被海洋帶走了，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "被海洋浸濕，就再也回不去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "她有得選嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助祭”",
      "text": "沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "那我想，我也沒有，對嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "走吧，助手，做事得有始有終。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "灌滿海洋的不是水。\n是墨，是油，是色彩。\n它浸潤了深海色的每一根神經，刷去了她心中所有的情感。\n她變得純粹，變得完美。\n許多聲音同她一起鳴唱，呼喊著生存的和諧。\n她湊上前去，想要應和那聲音。\n但她沒唱，她拿起了筆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鳴唱戛然而止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助手”",
      "text": "生存的表達不應是這樣的，深海色。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "我還活著，我想要畫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助手”",
      "text": "繪畫沒有防衛效果，繪畫不能補充營養，這是種錯誤的生存邏輯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "是啊，但畫畫就是活著，我怎麼能不畫呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "筆尖沾著海墨，色彩在水中飛舞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助手”",
      "text": "你忘記自己擁抱海洋的初衷了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "我當然記得，為了生存拋棄繪畫，在那苦恨中走向末路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "所以她溺死了，我還活著，我要表達。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "不再拋棄色彩，不再捨離紙筆，我再也不願停下了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "一起來畫吧，助手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助手”",
      "text": "我們應當積蓄能量，克服弱點，力求進化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "是啊，我們能夠在繪畫上更進一步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“助手”",
      "text": "那是進化的謬誤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "就算是吧，那又怎麼樣呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "我不會，也不想聽從大群的呼喚。我將僅剩的自我全留給繪畫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "隨著她的筆，她的塗抹，她的表達，海底逐漸鋪滿了色彩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "即使是海水，都抵擋不住這股宣洩。\n海水與油墨混合散開，不久後又攪到一起，循環往復，終究還是在這海洋中留下了烙印。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "快來，助手，我一個人忙不過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "別讓色塊散開，把它聚攏到我這裡來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "你說什麼？那些同胞走遠了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "那是它們的大群，和我們，和我又有什麼關係？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "調色完成了嗎？海洋還等著我們為它染上色彩呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "助手，你還在嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "助手？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "呼，就畫到這裡吧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深海色面前的畫布上，數個藍色色塊組成了畫面的主體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "這是關於我們的故事，不過最後的處理是不是太過激烈了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "調色盤中伸展而出的細長腕足左右搖晃著，也不知道是在肯定還是在否定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "可能是因為海嗣的生活實在太壓抑了，用些激進的表達方式來抗議那段生活，應該也無可厚非吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "那這幅畫就結束了。我得把它蓋好再處理一下，不然周邊的幹員再來投訴，人事部的人真的會把我從船上趕下去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "難得有一個不受那些傢伙騷擾，能夠安心畫畫的地方。我可不想再東躲西藏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島信使",
      "text": "您好，有您的信件！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島信使",
      "text": "深海色幹員對吧，這是您訂的東西，一些繪畫耗材和一個畫框。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "是的，謝謝你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島信使",
      "text": "請先確認一下，無誤的話請在這裡簽個名。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "是這裡嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島信使",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "好……完成！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島信使",
      "text": "我還以為您的字也會是藍色的呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島信使",
      "text": "那祝您今天生活愉快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "謝謝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "嘿咻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深海色",
      "text": "那麼，下一幅畫什麼好呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
